{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Fet3oIQ5wN1793095282.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>劉穎鏇在社交平台大晒一輯極具型格的風格寫真，展現帥氣兼性感的一面，隨即引來大批網民圍觀讚好！</p><p></p><p>相中所見，劉穎鏇穿上 Oversized 西裝外套搭配同色系寬鬆長褲，內搭一件白色短款背心，大方展露極其超強馬甲線與健美腹肌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"619a7a04-a34a-4379-9bf2-6dedd3668a47.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026RIr1Gn7yNU1793095281.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c3807534-a8c3-4b02-aeef-cdc79f825efa.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/202696Uss2VzsI1793095281.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>劉穎鏇亦在貼文中以英文感嘆年尾將至，感性留言：「nearing the end of the year and i’m on the hunt to make more memories 🥰 what are you looking forward to most before the year ends? 💚」</p><p></p><p>劉穎鏇除了問及大家在年尾最期待些甚麼之外，亦表達了自己希望在今年結束前創造更多美好回憶的心情。這輯兼具帥氣與健康的健美靚相曝光後，不少網民與圈中好友紛紛留言激讚她的身材管理極佳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.334818+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:14.785194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:27.977706+00:00","content_hash":"0d48f748d3129294cbc222c16cc20a5ce10d6616020fd7a4089ca3fef30f9123","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.334818+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}